00:12:59.511 --> 00:13:01.580
-[ Coughing ]

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:05.784
-Yes?
What -- What is that?

00:13:05.784 --> 00:13:07.285
-Stay golden, Pony Boy.

00:13:07.285 --> 00:13:10.489
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:10.489 --> 00:13:13.092
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:13:13.092 --> 00:13:15.761
Stay golden --
Stay golden, Pony Boy.

00:13:15.761 --> 00:13:17.263
[ Laughter ]

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:21.066
-Truer words
have never been spoken.

00:13:21.066 --> 00:13:24.202
-Look, all you have to do
is look deep...

00:13:24.202 --> 00:13:25.237
[ Laughs ]

00:13:25.237 --> 00:13:26.905
[ Laughter ]

00:13:26.905 --> 00:13:28.574
...within your per--

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:30.576
[ Laughter ]

00:13:30.576 --> 00:13:33.078
"Perenium."

00:13:33.078 --> 00:13:34.245
-Perineum.
-Perineum.

00:13:34.245 --> 00:13:37.917
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:37.917 --> 00:13:40.286
You remember
Dad used to say that, as well.

00:13:40.286 --> 00:13:41.553
[ Laughter ]

00:13:41.553 --> 00:13:46.225
You got to look deep...
for the holiday spirit.

00:13:46.225 --> 00:13:48.494
Come on, man. You can do it.

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:50.328
-You're right, brother.

00:13:50.328 --> 00:13:52.030
The holidays are magical.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.466
Decorating
the Christmas protractor.

00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:55.801
[ Laughter ]

00:13:55.801 --> 00:13:57.169
Hanging the puppies
on the mantel.

00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:58.203
[ Laughter ]

00:13:58.203 --> 00:14:00.739
And spending time
with all my dragons.

00:14:00.739 --> 00:14:01.840
[ Laughter ]

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.375
I believe again!

00:14:03.375 --> 00:14:06.411
There is a Santa Claus!

00:14:06.411 --> 00:14:09.814
-Teacher, my name's not Dave!

00:14:09.814 --> 00:14:12.651
-You know, the best part
about believing in Santa

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:15.354
is getting to sing
my favorite song with you.

00:14:15.354 --> 00:14:16.555
-[ Laughs ]

00:14:16.555 --> 00:14:18.457
You sure you don't
want to do it by yourself?

00:14:18.457 --> 00:14:19.925
[ Laughter ]

00:14:19.925 --> 00:14:22.193
-Which is...?
-What is the song?

00:14:22.193 --> 00:14:25.864
-"Rudolph the Sea-Breeze-Nosed
WWE Superstar."

00:14:25.864 --> 00:14:27.265
[ Laughter ]

00:14:27.265 --> 00:14:31.036
Man, I screwed myself on that.
-That is my favorite song.

00:14:31.036 --> 00:14:33.705
Let's sing!
[ Clears throat ]

00:14:33.705 --> 00:14:38.277
♪ Rudolph the sea-breeze-nosed
WWE Superstar ♪

00:14:38.277 --> 00:14:41.580
♪ Had a very shiny anus ♪

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.847
[ Laughter ]

00:14:42.847 --> 00:14:46.384
♪ And if you ever saw it ♪

00:14:46.384 --> 00:14:47.519
-Jumped.

00:14:47.519 --> 00:14:50.221
-♪ You would even say
it jumped ♪

00:14:50.221 --> 00:14:51.790
And scene.
Go run to your room.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:52.925
Go run to your room.

